{
  "info": {
    "name": "Turnos Medicos - Semana 4 (Reportes)",
    "description": "Reportes y estadisticas (Semana 4). Consultas agregadas sobre turno/agenda/especialidad/sede. Todos los endpoints son SOLO para el rol administrador (otro rol -> 403; sin token -> 401) y admiten filtro por rango de fechas del turno (?desde=&hasta=, YYYY-MM-DD).\n\nUso: 1) 'Login admin' guarda token_admin. 2) Correr los 4 reportes. 3) Probar el filtro de fechas y los 403/401.\n\nRespuesta uniforme { codigo, estado, datos }.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:3000" },
    { "key": "token_admin", "value": "" },
    { "key": "token_medico", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Login admin",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "var d = pm.response.json();",
              "if (d.datos && d.datos.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token_admin', d.datos.token); }"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"dni\": \"18222333\",\n  \"password\": \"clinica123\"\n}" },
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Login medico (para probar 403)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "var d = pm.response.json();",
              "if (d.datos && d.datos.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token_medico', d.datos.token); }"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"dni\": \"20111222\",\n  \"password\": \"clinica123\"\n}" },
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Turnos por especialidad",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_admin}}" }],
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/reportes/turnos-por-especialidad", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["reportes", "turnos-por-especialidad"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Turnos por sede",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_admin}}" }],
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/reportes/turnos-por-sede", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["reportes", "turnos-por-sede"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Ranking de medicos (por atendidos)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_admin}}" }],
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/reportes/ranking-medicos", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["reportes", "ranking-medicos"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Tasa de cancelacion",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_admin}}" }],
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/reportes/tasa-cancelacion", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["reportes", "tasa-cancelacion"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Reporte con filtro de fechas (?desde=&hasta=)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_admin}}" }],
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/reportes/turnos-por-especialidad?desde=2025-01-01&hasta=2030-12-31", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["reportes", "turnos-por-especialidad"], "query": [{ "key": "desde", "value": "2025-01-01" }, { "key": "hasta", "value": "2030-12-31" }] }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Reporte con rol medico -> 403",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_medico}}" }],
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/reportes/tasa-cancelacion", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["reportes", "tasa-cancelacion"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Reporte sin token -> 401",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/reportes/tasa-cancelacion", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["reportes", "tasa-cancelacion"] }
      }
    }
  ]
}
